# Client-side libraries are referenced, not committed.
#
# libman.json is the manifest; Microsoft.Web.LibraryManager.Build restores these
# as part of `dotnet build`, so a fresh clone, the CI runner and `dotnet publish`
# all get them automatically with no extra step.
#
# Restoring to disk rather than linking a CDN is deliberate: the Task 2
# presentation is a live demonstration, and a CDN that campus wifi blocks would
# make the site look broken in front of the marker. The published application is
# self-contained; only git is kept clean.
lib/
